WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.867
This looks like

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.002
a lot of Top Gun,

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:02.902
but it's real

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.204
and it's between the United States

00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:04.704
and Russia.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:05.438
Just watching

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.307
this video is amazing

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:09.442
to see these two Russian fighter jets

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.777
come up to this American drone,

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:11.911
this Reaper drone, dump

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.680
fuel on it, clip it.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.715
That has led to this dramatic escalation.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.484
The Russians have been insisting

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:18.551
that that fighter jet,

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.486
the Russian fighter jet

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.488
did not ever make contact

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:22.689
with that drone.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:22.822
Well,

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.124
now we can see that

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.825
the video really does belie

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.260
that explanation.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.728
We're seeing that the fighter jet

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.829
actually comes up

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.931
extremely close to the drone.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:32.966
You're watching it right there.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.234
Starts releasing

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:35.902
a lot of jet fuel as U.S.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:36.970
officials had said it did.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.605
It hits that drone.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.673
That is when the camera footage goes out.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.175
And then when the camera footage

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.276
reappears,

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:46.446
you can see that the propeller of

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.148
that drone is damaged.

